The 1930 Gurmukhi text of Gurushabad Ratnakar Mahan Kosh
(Bhai Kahan Singh Nabha) is in the public domain.

This compiled dataset (English text from the Punjabi University
Patiala edition, Hindi, machine translations, JSON packaging, and
the viewer in site/) is released under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may use, share, and adapt this work, including commercially,
if you give appropriate credit.

Suggested attribution:

  Mahan Kosh multilingual dataset, from Bhai Kahan Singh Nabha,
  Gurushabad Ratnakar Mahan Kosh (1930); English after Punjabi
  University Patiala (2006–2011). Packaged by Sikhi.io
  (https://sikhi.io/dictionary), in honour of Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji.

Machine-translated languages have not been reviewed by native
speakers or subject scholars.
